{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a magical adventure in <strong>\u00d6rn\u00f6ga</strong>! Master powerful spells, collect epic loot, and uncover ancient secrets as you grow from a novice mage to an archwizard. Upgrade your abilities, automate your spellcasting, and watch your power grow\u2014even while you're away.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up and earn Stat Points</strong> to distribute across seven unique Stats, customizing your build to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up spells from four distinct elements</strong>, mastering their power to enhance your abilities in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect epic loot</strong> that that manipulates your spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire powerful mercenaries</strong> to assist you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536530/extras/0d11f3b82020e91a9b85cc740a226e22.poster.avif?t=1769442130\" width=800 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536530/extras/0d11f3b82020e91a9b85cc740a226e22.webm?t=1769442130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536530/extras/0d11f3b82020e91a9b85cc740a226e22.mp4?t=1769442130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00d6rn\u00f6ga</strong> is an idle game where your character fights and explores on their own, requiring no manual input. However, if you prefer a more hands-on approach, you can take control by using character-specific skills and controlling your hero. While playing actively isn\u2019t necessary, it can give you an edge in 